/// Tool parser for InternLM2 action-wrapped JSON tool calls.
///
/// Example tool call content:
///
/// ```text
/// <|action_start|><|plugin|>
/// {"name": "get_weather", "parameters": {"location":"Tokyo"}}<|action_end|>
/// ```
///
/// Arguments are already OpenAI-style JSON text, so they are streamed as raw
/// argument deltas without schema conversion or JSON normalization.
///
/// The `<|action_start|>`, `<|plugin|>`, and `<|action_end|>` sentinels are
